# Only these four files are ever pushed to Apps Script.
# Everything else in this folder (notes, git, setup docs) stays local.
#
# The idiom is "ignore everything, then un-ignore what we want" — safer than
# listing exclusions, because a new local file can never leak into the live
# project by accident.
**/**

!appsscript.json
!Code.gs
!Index.html
!Styles.html
